<title>GERMANY: Trade in Rheinelektra, Lahmeyer suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Rheinelektra, Lahmeyer suspended.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Deutsche Boerse German stock exchange said on Wednesday it was suspending trade in utilities Rheinelektra AG and Lahmeyer, who have previously said they were considering a merger.</p>
<p>Both firms are majority-held by the large Essen-based holding group RWE AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
